; Probe two cells side by side
;
; ORs the tile flags of the cells at (x+B, y+C) and (x+B+3, y+C) into E (E starts at 0). Used for the head and the
; feet of the standing monk (#R$A8A5). B is left increased by 3.
; .
; Hardware: none; reads the tile flag map.
;
; HL Position: H = x, L = y (2-pixel units)
; B Offset of the first point in x
; C Offset of the first point in y
; D Column mask (always $1F)
; O:E OR of the tile flags at the points
; O:B B + 3
@label=ProbePair
c$A9B4 LD E,$00   ;
 $A9B6 CALL $A9FE ;
 $A9B9 INC B      ;
 $A9BA INC B      ;
 $A9BB INC B      ;
 $A9BC JP $A9FE   ;
